# External upstream clones - not vendored here. Each is a full separate git
# checkout of someone else's project, with our work-in-progress patches
# sitting uncommitted inside it. Reproduce them with:
#   git clone https://github.com/pjsny/policy-clash.git
#   git clone --branch 4.0 https://github.com/PufferAI/PufferLib.git pufferlib
#   git clone https://github.com/pjsny/policy-clash-re-tools.git
# then copy the matching files from env-src/ over the checkout (see
# env-src/README.md) to reapply our changes. policy-clash-re-tools has
# none to reapply - it's a read-only oracle harness against the shipped
# game, not something this project patches.
/policy-clash/
/pufferlib/
/policy-clash-re-tools/

# Training run artifacts - reproducible outputs, not source.
/training/checkpoints/*.pt
/training/train.log

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/

# OS
.DS_Store
